                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/2804: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Vice Consul in Charge at Blue fields</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Waters</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-09-02T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 2,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your August 31, 9 a.m. U.S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Asheville</hi> due to
                    arrive Bluefields September 3d.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
